{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q409799","formula":"CHBr₃","hill":"CHBr3","elements":["H","C","Br"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"H":1.0,"Br":3.0},"names":{"en":"Bromoform","ru":"Бромоформ"},"descriptions":{"en":"Bromoform is an organic compound with the chemical formula CHBr3. It is a colorless liquid at room temperature, with a high refractive index and a very high density. Its sweet odor is similar to that of chloroform.","ru":"Бромоформ (трибромметан) CHBr3 — галогеналкан, бесцветная жидкость со сладковатым запахом хлороформа, легко разлагается на воздухе под действием света. Небольшое количество синтезируется растениями в океане. Плохо растворим в воде, одна часть на 800 частей воды, и легко испаряется в атмосферу."},"fame":31,"pubchemCid":5558,"mass":252.73,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(Br)(Br)Br","inchikey":"DIKBFYAXUHHXCS-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"bromoform","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5558","atoms":5,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.089,"y":1.861,"z":0.139,"el":"Br"},{"x":1.656,"y":-0.853,"z":0.139,"el":"Br"},{"x":-1.567,"y":-1.007,"z":0.139,"el":"Br"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":-0.417,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":-1.51,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,3,1],[1,3,1],[2,3,1],[3,4,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q409799","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bromoform","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/5558","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"structure","name":"PubChem 3D","url":"https://pubchem